                The Design Tools Lab (DTL) is a research group dedicated to supporting people realizing their creative potential. 
            </p>
            <p>
                We develop design software, toolkits, and learning experiences that enable people to build and share projects representing their ideas, identities, and values. We are especially interested in creative computing design tools that support beginners developing computational fluency, with prior work centered on <span class="machine-learning area">machine learning</span>, <span class="visual-arts area">visual arts</span>, <span class="electronics area">electronics</span>, and <span class="documentation area">design documentation</span>. 
